# HED-FLORAL-03 — Magnolia–Peony Satin — Basket 01–18 Mixing Protocol — 30 mL — v2

**Source formula:** `HED-FLORAL-03_Magnolia_Peony_Satin_FINAL_30mL_v2.md`  
**Finished volume:** 30,000 µL / 30.00 mL  
**Aromatic-stock charge:** 2,900 µL  
**Essential-oil use:** Magnolia EO, 60 µL as supplied  
**Rule:** Process Basket 1 through Basket 18 numerically. Within each occupied basket, add highest raw µL to lowest raw µL.

