| 1 | Hexyl Salicylate | neat | **700 µL** |
| 2 | Benzyl Benzoate | neat | **240 µL** |
| 3 | Benzyl Salicylate | neat | **180 µL** |
| 4 | Hedione | neat | **40 µL** |

**Basket subtotal:** 1,160 µL. Stir until uniform.

